# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Send the www subdomain to the bare apex domain (the canonical URL used in
# the page's meta tags), preserving any path via :splat. 301 = permanent.
#
# Prerequisite: add `www.issiriaiavailableineu.com` as a custom domain on the
# Pages project too (Custom domains → Set up a custom domain). The request has
# to reach Pages for this rule to fire — otherwise www just won't resolve.
https://www.issiriaiavailableineu.com/* https://issiriaiavailableineu.com/:splat 301
